---
<MainGridLayout title={i18n(I18nKey.friends)} description={i18n(I18nKey.friends)}>
    <div class="flex w-full rounded-[var(--radius-large)] overflow-hidden relative min-h-32">
        <div class="card-base z-10 px-9 py-6 relative w-full">
            <Markdown class="mt-2">
                <h2>友链列表</h2>
                
                <style>
                .friend-card {
                  display: flex;
                  align-items: center;
                  width: 100%;
                  min-height: 48px;
                  text-decoration: none !important;
                  color: inherit;
                  outline: none !important;
                  border: none !important;
                  box-sizing: border-box;
                  transition: background 0.2s;
                  padding-left: 20px;
                }
                .friend-card:focus,
                .friend-card:hover {
                  outline: none !important;
                  border: none !important;
                  text-decoration: none !important;
                  background: #f5f5f5;
                }
                .friend-card img {
                  margin-left: 20px;
                  margin-right: 8px;
                }
                </style>

                <table style="border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0 10px;">
                  {friendLinks.reduce((rows, friend, index) => {
                    if (index % 2 === 0) {
                      rows.push([friend]);
                    } else {
                      rows[rows.length - 1].push(friend);
                    }
                    return rows;
                  }, []).map(row => (
                    <tr>
                      {row.map(friend => (
                        <td style="padding:8px 8px; width:320px;">
                          <a href={friend.siteurl} target="_blank" class="friend-card">
                            <img src={friend.imgurl} width="32" height="32" alt={`${friend.title}头像`}/>
                            <div>
                              <b>{friend.title}</b><br/>
                              <span style="font-size:12px;">{friend.desc}</span>
                            </div>
                          </a>
                        </td>
                      ))}
                      {row.length === 1 && <td style="padding:8px 8px; width:320px;"></td>}
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </table>

                <p>添加完我的友链后请通过<strong>评论</strong>或<a href="mailto:i@sakura.ink">i@sakura.ink</a>以下面的格式（不做要求，我看得懂就行）联系我添加你的友链</p>

                <div style="position: relative;">
                  <pre><code id="friend-link-code">title: "鈴奈咲桜のBlog",
imgurl: "https://q2.qlogo.cn/headimg_dl?dst_uin=2731443459&spec=5",
desc: "愛することを忘れないで",
siteurl: "https://blog.sakura.ink",</code></pre>
                  <button 
                    id="copy-friend-link"
                    style="position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; padding: 6px 12px; background: var(--btn-regular-bg); border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; transition: all 0.2s;"
                    onmouseover="this.style.background='var(--btn-card-bg-hover)'"
                    onmouseout="this.style.background='var(--btn-regular-bg)'"
                  >
                    复制
                  </button>
                </div>

                <script is:inline>
                  document.getElementById('copy-friend-link')?.addEventListener('click', function() {
                    const code = document.getElementById('friend-link-code')?.textContent || '';
                    navigator.clipboard.writeText(code).then(() => {
                      const btn = this;
                      const originalText = btn.textContent;
                      btn.textContent = '已复制!';
                      btn.style.background = 'var(--primary)';
                      btn.style.color = 'white';
                      setTimeout(() => {
                        btn.textContent = originalText;
                        btn.style.background = 'var(--btn-regular-bg)';
                        btn.style.color = '';
                      }, 2000);
                    }).catch(err => {
                      console.error('复制失败:', err);
                      alert('复制失败，请手动复制');
                    });
                  });
                </script>

                <Comments client:only="svelte"></Comments>
            </Markdown>
        </div>
    </div>
</MainGridLayout>
